      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: yea most likely, I play CSGO faceit and valorant plus use windows 11 pro with hardware security features. It doesn't happen that often in other EAC games, but in VRChat it does (idk what type of EAC version vrc is using). I encountered this in battlebit remastered like twice in my 37 hour total playtime. In apex legends never, but that's most likely because apex doesn't use out of box EAC (they've edited it themselves).",
