  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As of now and since EAC addition, to fix any EAC related issue you have to reinstall whole VRChat since an average user has no idea what type of command line arguments VRChat uses to reinstall and install the EAC installation. In other games such as Rust and Battlebit Remastered EAC setup file brings up a screen with repair option. I would like this to be added to VRChat as well, since I get createfile 32 error quite often for whatever reasons.",
